.TH start-container-notification-create 1  "create " 
.SH NAME
start\-container\-notification\-create \- Send a notification from this service
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-container notification create\fR [\fB\-\-data\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILEVEL\fR> <\fITITLE\fR> <\fIMESSAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send a notification from this service
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<DATA>\fR
Markdown details shown with the notification
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILEVEL\fR>
Notification severity level
.TP
<\fITITLE\fR>
Notification title
.TP
<\fIMESSAGE\fR>
Notification message content
